__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.aux
*.log
*.out
# NOTE: data/jobs.db, application_log.csv, resumes/tailored/*, and
# resumes/diffs/* are intentionally NOT ignored — the GitHub Actions
# workflow commits them back to the repo after every run so state
# (what's already been seen, what's been tailored) persists between
# runs on a fresh runner. See .github/workflows/daily-job-search.yml.
